{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40852","headline":"赠翁承赞漆林书堂诗 · 萧项","name":"赠翁承赞漆林书堂诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轺车故国世应稀，昔日书堂二纪归。\n手植松筠同茂盛，身荣金紫倍光辉。\n入门邻里喧迎接，列坐儿童见等威。\n却对芸窗勤苦处，举头全是锦爲衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧项","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40852.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40852","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}